{"seq":51,"slug":"local-first-sync-engines","title":"本地优先与同步引擎","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"本地优先与同步引擎-总览\">本地优先与同步引擎·总览</h1><p>把一份数据放在用户设备上、让应用在断网时照常读写、再让多台设备最终收敛到一致——这件事过去要么交给云端权威服务器、要么干脆放弃，而 2026 年它已经凝结成一类可复用的基础设施：同步引擎。本 hub 讲的不是&quot;再写一个 WebSocket 推送&quot;，而是一整套把本地状态当作真相来源、把网络当作异步收敛通道的工程范式。</p>\n<p>四个章节是一条递进的主线，建议按顺序读。<strong>基础</strong>回答&quot;为什么要这样做、它和传统请求-响应模型差在哪&quot;：从 Ink &amp; Switch 提出的本地优先七原则出发，把离线与冲突的本质难点摆清楚，再说明同步引擎为何不是又一层缓存。<strong>数据与一致性</strong>回答&quot;多副本怎么不打架&quot;：这是整个领域的理论地基，CRDT、OT 与因果时钟都在这里一次讲透，后续章节只引用不重复展开。<strong>引擎</strong>回答&quot;现成的轮子有哪些、各自的取舍是什么&quot;：协作文档代表 Yjs、服务端权威同步代表 ElectricSQL 与 Zero、部分同步代表 Replicache 这条谱系。<strong>实践</strong>回答&quot;上线前还差哪几道坎&quot;：模式迁移、权限边界、离线 UX，这三件事决定一个 demo 能不能变成产品。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</strong>要先划清，否则容易重复。隔壁 <a href=\"../pwa-offline-first/\">PWA 与离线优先</a> 讲的是 Service Worker 缓存 HTTP 响应、让&quot;页面壳&quot;离线可用，那是<strong>资源缓存</strong>视角；本 hub 讲的是<strong>应用数据</strong>如何离线读写并多端收敛，是缓存解决不了的一层。<a href=\"../realtime-collaborative-frontend/\">实时协作前端</a> 与本 hub 在 CRDT 上有交集，但它侧重传输层（WebSocket/WebRTC/SSE）与在线协作的临场感，本 hub 侧重离线持久与同步引擎产品形态；CRDT 理论以本 hub 的 <a href=\"data-consistency/\">数据与一致性</a> 为权威详解。底层存储（IndexedDB、OPFS、配额）属于 <a href=\"../browser-storage-persistence/\">浏览器存储与持久化</a>，本 hub 把它当已知前提。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>：如果你是想快速选型的工程师，先读 <a href=\"foundations/sync-engine-vs-rest\">同步引擎与传统请求模型</a>，再直接跳到 <a href=\"engines/\">引擎</a> 章对照取舍。如果你要自己实现合并逻辑，<strong>数据与一致性</strong>整章是必修，尤其 <a href=\"data-consistency/crdts-for-apps\">应用层 CRDT</a> 与 <a href=\"data-consistency/causal-consistency-clocks\">因果一致性与时钟</a>。如果你已经选好引擎、正在把 demo 推向生产，<strong>实践</strong>章的三篇是你的检查清单。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：你应当熟悉 JavaScript/TypeScript、HTTP 请求-响应模型、关系型数据库与事务的基本概念，了解 Promise 与异步编程。不需要分布式系统背景——因果时钟、最终一致这些概念本 hub 会从零讲起。读完整个 hub，你应当能判断一个产品该不该上本地优先、该选哪类引擎、以及上线前要堵住哪些坑。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"local-first-principles","title":"本地优先七原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/foundations/local-first-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"offline-conflict-challenges","title":"离线与冲突的本质挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/foundations/offline-conflict-challenges"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sync-engine-vs-rest","title":"同步引擎与传统请求模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/foundations/sync-engine-vs-rest"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-consistency","title":"数据与一致性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/data-consistency","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crdts-for-apps","title":"应用层 CRDT","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/data-consistency/crdts-for-apps"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ot-vs-crdt","title":"OT 与 CRDT 对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/data-consistency/ot-vs-crdt"},{"seq":3,"slug":"causal-consistency-clocks","title":"因果一致性与时钟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/data-consistency/causal-consistency-clocks"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"engines","title":"引擎","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/engines","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"yjs-collaborative","title":"Yjs 与协作文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/engines/yjs-collaborative"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sync-engines-electric-zero","title":"同步引擎 ElectricSQL 与 Zero","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/engines/sync-engines-electric-zero"},{"seq":3,"slug":"replicache-partial-sync","title":"部分同步与查询订阅","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/engines/replicache-partial-sync"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"schema-migration-sync","title":"模式迁移与版本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/practice/schema-migration-sync"},{"seq":2,"slug":"auth-permission-sync","title":"权限与安全边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/practice/auth-permission-sync"},{"seq":3,"slug":"offline-ux-patterns","title":"离线 UX 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/practice/offline-ux-patterns"}]}]}